      "writtenOn": "2020-03-03T19:29:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s in 8.3.3.18.9.1 of the PD 3.0 Version 2.0 spec (PE_DR_SNK_Get_Sink_Cap State):\n\nThe Policy Engine Shall transition back to the PE_SNK_Ready state (see Figure 8-76) when:\nA Sink_Capabilities Message is received\nOr SenderResponseTimer times out\nOr a Reject Message is received.\nPage 548\n\nIt looks like the Reject Message section wasn\u0027t updated to include this usage, which I believe is new in PD 3.0",
